Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] usb: mtu3: implement MT6897 force-VBUS and role lifecycle

Honor the board force-VBUS property and implement dual-role resource
ownership, host startup and device teardown for MT6897.

